{# Variables: paper, passages #}
Extract structured methodology attributes from the paper below.

PAPER: "{{ paper.title | replace('"', "'") }}" (paper_id={{ paper.paper_id }})

PASSAGES:
{% for p in passages %}
[P{{ paper.paper_id }}-{{ loop.index }}] {{ p.text }}
{% endfor %}

OUTPUT: STRICT JSON matching MethodologyExtraction:
  - paper_id: "{{ paper.paper_id }}"
  - datasets: list of dataset names (strings) mentioned in the passages
  - techniques: list of technique/method names (strings)
  - metrics: list of evaluation metric names (strings)
Empty lists allowed when the passages do not mention these attributes.
